  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The initial alloy is a refractory HEA based on W, Mo, Ta, Nb, and V in near-equimolar ratios.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6513993::web::001::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Such WMoTaNbV alloys are typically produced without surface modification.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pack cementation aluminizing at 900°C for 6 hours using an Al-rich powder pack will produce a uniform, adherent alumina scale on WMoTaNbV.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6513993::web::001::introduction",
        "PMC6513993::web::009::discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Controlled cooling and in situ scale evaluation can ensure defect-free, strongly adhered alumina formation.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The treated alloy will possess a continuous and uniform Al2O3 scale.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6513993::web::009::discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Al2O3 is thermodynamically stable and has low oxygen permeability at high temperature.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6513993::web::001::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "During aluminizing, aluminum diffuses into the near-surface region and oxidizes to form alumina.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A continuous alumina scale acts as a physical barrier that impedes oxygen ingress into the alloy.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6513993::web::001::introduction",
        "PMC6513993::web::009::discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The alumina layer will be slow-growing.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6513993::web::001::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "At 1100°C in air for 50 hours, the aluminized alloy will have a lower oxidation rate and reduced mass gain relative to untreated WMoTaNbV.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6513993::web::001::introduction",
        "PMC6513993::web::009::discussion",
        "PMC6513993::web::017::discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The aluminized alloy will retain mechanical integrity better than the untreated alloy during high-temperature exposure.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6513993::web::001::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Untreated refractory HEAs show substantial oxide-scale growth and oxidation-related mass gain at 1100°C.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6513993::web::009::discussion",
        "PMC6513993::web::017::discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The alumina barrier should remain effective during at least 50 hours of isothermal exposure at 1100°C in air.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6513993::web::001::introduction",
        "PMC6513993::web::017::discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Performance under cyclic thermal or mechanical stress remains unvalidated.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Failure to obtain a statistically significant reduction in mass gain or failure to form a uniform, adherent Al2O3 scale relative to the untreated control would falsify the hypothesis.",
      "field": "falsification_experiment.falsification_rule",
      "needs_support": false,
